<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        <a href="/manage/compliance">Compliance</a> gathers everything that needs chasing in one place, for your
        location. Admins can choose any location, or all of them.
    </FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="The sections">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Overdue training</strong>: assignments past their due date and not completed. Shown when
                your company has Training.</li>
            <li><strong>Expired documents</strong>: staff documents whose expiry date has passed. Shown when your
                company has Onboarding.</li>
            <li><strong>Documents expiring soon</strong>: documents that expire within the number of days in
                <strong>Documents expiring within (days)</strong>, 30 by default.</li>
        </ul>
        <FluentText>
            Each section shows how many items there are and how many people they affect, or "Nothing
            outstanding". The same summary is available as the Compliance at a Glance dashboard widget.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Clearing items">
        <ul>
            <li>Select an overdue training row to go to the Training Dashboard's By Person tab. The item clears
                when the person completes the course, or if you change the due date.</li>
            <li>Select a document row to open the person's <strong>Documents</strong> tab. Upload the renewed
                document with its new expiry date and the item clears.</li>
        </ul>
        <FluentText>
            Staff are emailed when a document's reminder date arrives. See
            <a href="/help/onboarding?topic=documents">Onboarding help</a>.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
